        </div>

        <div class="post-detail__content">
          <p>In addition to monthly board meetings, the Board of the Community Foundation of Teton Valley sets aside one day a year to assemble for a Board Retreat. This time gives the Board a forum to review our mission, vision, strategy, priority goals, and key performance indicators.&nbsp;</p>

<p>This year, it also meant discussing the final assessment from our Community Feedback Survey that went out this Spring. Thank you to all those that participated in the survey and follow-up interviews to help inform the Community Foundation’s strategic plan.&nbsp;</p>

<p>As part of the day’s work, we want to share our Strategic Framework to give you a transparent look at our working plan. Thank you for your unwavering support of the Community Foundation and allowing us to transform your generosity into lasting impact for Teton Valley over the last 15 years! We greatly appreciate your support and are excited for our next chapter and the years ahead.</p>

